The MIT License above covers the module's code and its own content, including
its journals, items and spells. It does not cover the following, which keep
their own terms.

Card artwork (assets/images, and the art in the module's journal)
   The card artwork is the author's own design, made from images licensed
   from Adobe Stock and Pexels, and contains no AI-generated imagery. Those
   images remain the property of their creators and are not licensed under
   the MIT License. You may use the artwork only as part of this module; you
   may not extract it for use elsewhere. docs/art-sources.md lists the
   source of each card.

Fonts (assets/fonts)
   Cinzel and Spectral are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. See
   assets/fonts/OFL-Cinzel.txt and assets/fonts/OFL-Spectral.txt.

Dungeons & Dragons
